proc.cdp.morph_morph.desc = Gradually turns one spectrum into another, in amplitude and in frequency. CDP program: morph morph.

proc.nat.band_split.nombre = Band split
proc.nat.band_split.desc = Splits the sound into several frequency bands; each band is an output and opens its own row. Summed, they give back the original.

